Let me look at the AOSP `dispatchGesture` to find conditions for returning false / cancelling. Let me fetch the googlesource file but grep the relevant part. Since webfetch summarizes, maybe I can use `curl` via bash to fetch raw and grep. The sandbox has network. Let me curl the AOSP source and grep dispatchGesture.

